    "body": "## Is there a related GitHub Issue?\r\nhttps://github.com/cloudfoundry/korifi/issues/1091\r\n\r\n## What is this change about?\r\nChange all korifi crd's api group to `korifi.cloudfoundry.org`\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\nChanging the CRD API group is always a breaking change, however this is OK before we have an official release\r\n\r\n## Acceptance Steps\r\n* All tests passing\r\n* Everything should work as it used to after korifi redeployment\r\n\r\n## Tag your pair, your PM, and/or team\r\n@kieron-dev @georgethebeatle \r\n\r\n",
